| Report | Description | Use Case |
|--------|-------------|----------|
| **Stock on Hand per Contractor** | Current inventory held by each contractor | Monthly reconciliation |
| **Outstanding Allocations** | Unsigned/unacknowledged allocations | Follow-up on pending signatures |
| **Consumption vs Allocation** | Compare stock issued vs consumed | Identify slow-moving or hoarded stock |
| **Missing Serials** | Serial numbers allocated but not installed or returned | Investigate losses |
| **Allocation History** | Complete audit trail per contractor | Compliance audits, dispute resolution |
