- Check that `useAuth` context provides: `currentUser`, `isAuthenticated`, `loading`, `hasAnyPermission`, `hasAllPermissions`, `hasAnyRole` — read `src/contexts/AuthContext.tsx` first to verify what's exported
- Keep files under 300 lines
- Create ONE commit with all 3 fixes on branch `fix/security-seal`
- Commit message should explain the security fixes

